//! ADC pad functions of the SWM341 pin matrix.
//!
//! Generated by `scripts/gen_pin_func.py` from the vendor header
//! `SWM341_port.h` -- do not edit by hand.
//!
//! Each `Pin{n}Func` enumerates the ADC functions selectable on pin `{n}` of its
//! bank; the numeric value of every variant is the 4-bit code written into
//! `PORTx.FUNC0/FUNC1`. `ADCx_CHy` selects analog input channel `y` (function
//! code `15`, the analog path) and `ADCx_TRIGz` a hardware trigger. Code `0`
//! (generic GPIO) is omitted. Apply a variant with [`crate::gpio::set_function`]
//! after [`crate::gpio::acquire`].


